AnnoyingNinja is a small ninja that runs around your home screen. You can put your own face on it. As your phone use gets closer to the limit you choose, the ninja makes more copies. When the screen fills up, it is a gentle reason to put the phone down. It is a small tool for digital minimalism and digital detox. The face photo stays on this phone. Available in 4 languages: Japanese, English, Spanish, and Chinese.
